OL,3,GNEWSADriver accused of trying to murder
OL,4,Aman on electronic motorbike
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is to stand trial accused of
OL,7,Ftrying to kill a man who was on an
OL,8,Felectronic motorbike in Aberdeen.
OL,10,FSinem Aktas, 29, denies attempted
OL,11,Fmurder after an incident in June last
OL,12,Fyear.
OL,14,FIt is alleged he shouted at Kieron
OL,15,FMunro, went after him in his car at
OL,16,Fspeed, and hit the bike. The charge
OL,17,Fstates the rider ended up hitting the
OL,18,Froad.
OL,20,FLord Scott set a trial scheduled to
OL,21,Fbegin in 2028.
